    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Evidence limitations",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "OS is **documented** for current IaC-managed hosts or marked as **inferred** for DNS/Nmap clues. DNS observations here are a dated 18–25 Sep 2026 snapshot. Open-port evidence comes from selected-port enrichment and completed Nmap results; a timed-out scan is never reported as zero open ports."
      }
